        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛡️ RAIDBOUND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Tactical Viking Auto-Battler with Roguelite Worker Placement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Raidbound</i>, you lead a clan of fearless Vikings through a mythic gauntlet of combat, sacrifice, and divine favor. This is no idle expedition—each decision shapes the fate of your warband.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit your warriors from the Tavern, train them in the ways of battle, and prepare them for war. Infuse them with ancient runes, forge legendary weapons, or sacrifice them to strengthen the clan. Once your energy for the year is spent, you must Raid—battling another player’s clan in asynchronous auto-combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, travel across a living map of strategic Nodes. Each offers a different boon—or risk. The road to glory is yours to choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/314f6c268b4748b8014d8d4dfb52594d.poster.avif?t=1763397478\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/314f6c268b4748b8014d8d4dfb52594d.webm?t=1763397478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/314f6c268b4748b8014d8d4dfb52594d.mp4?t=1763397478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔️ Vikings &amp; Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Viking joins your clan with a unique ability and one of four roles:<br><strong>Raider</strong>, <strong>Warden</strong>, <strong>Berserker</strong>, or <strong>Skirmisher</strong>.<br>Roles create synergies—like Wardens granting bonus armor when grouped.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can equip up to 4 abilities per Viking, unlocked by infusing them with Runes.<br>Combat is fully automated, but strategic: Vikings attack based on speed, targeting (frontline, backline, or random), and ability loadout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose a <strong>Raid</strong>, and you lose a life. When you’re out—your run ends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/f19902d41282c9d9855a101c12993782.poster.avif?t=1763397478\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/f19902d41282c9d9855a101c12993782.webm?t=1763397478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/f19902d41282c9d9855a101c12993782.mp4?t=1763397478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧠 HERO PASSIVES &amp; ABILITY SYNERGIES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run, choose from a variety of <strong>hero powers</strong> that shape your overall strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passives range from <strong>tank-saving effects</strong> to <strong>formation-breaking wildcards</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack <strong>buffs, status effects, and rune enhancements</strong> to create emergent combos across your Vikings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay value comes from <strong>mixing heroes, drafting new powers</strong>, and discovering devastating synergy chains.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/73a13eaa03ea8e3e99977ac0ea0c09d3.poster.avif?t=1763397478\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/73a13eaa03ea8e3e99977ac0ea0c09d3.webm?t=1763397478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/73a13eaa03ea8e3e99977ac0ea0c09d3.mp4?t=1763397478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🪓 RUNE-ENHANCED CREW SYSTEM</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn and equip powerful <strong>Runes</strong> to augment your Vikings with effects like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burn, poison, bleed, freeze, haste, armor, and more.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment is <strong>consumable power boosts</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build run-specific loadouts to <strong>adapt to enemy types and draft RNG</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔁 ROGUELITE PROGRESSION LOOP</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a series of <strong>PvE and PvP rounds</strong>, each more intense than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Losing a PvP battle costs lives — but clever planning ensures you stay in the fight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each victory earns rewards and choices that evolve your strategy for the next encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs end when all Vikings fall… or you become the <strong>top Jarl</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/0622e859b7cdae694d37d90087428cf7.poster.avif?t=1763397478\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/0622e859b7cdae694d37d90087428cf7.webm?t=1763397478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/0622e859b7cdae694d37d90087428cf7.mp4?t=1763397478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/a188a8cd43c68f0850ed2b28a74c7b0d.poster.avif?t=1763397478\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/a188a8cd43c68f0850ed2b28a74c7b0d.webm?t=1763397478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/a188a8cd43c68f0850ed2b28a74c7b0d.mp4?t=1763397478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🗺️ CHOOSE YOUR PATH: KEY NODES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sparring Pit</strong> – Face rival clans to earn gold and glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunting Grounds</strong> – Hunt prey to gather rations and empower future recruits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold Mine</strong> – Mine ore safely… or risk it all for a greater haul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blacksmith</strong> – Forge weapons and armor to power up your entire warband.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Odin’s Trial</strong> – Send one Viking to receive a divine gift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ritual Site</strong> – Sacrifice a Viking; their strength flows into the rest of your clan.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runesmith</strong> – Choose one of three powerful runes to permanently enhance a Viking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gambler’s Den</strong> – Risk any resource—gold, rations, even lives—for a chance at glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voyage (Post-Demo)</strong> – Set sail to earn powerful relics, if you can brave the sea.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thor’s Blessing</strong> – Gain extra energy to extend your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Odin's Gift</strong> – Gain 2 lives when you are on your last life. Only usable once.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystic </strong>– Revisit previously used nodes for greater flexibility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚖️ Dishonor &amp; Rerolls</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Gods offer choices, you may not always agree.<br>Spend <strong>glory</strong> to reroll—but each reroll increases <strong>Dishonor</strong>, making future choices riskier and more expensive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛠️ KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Deep tactical auto-battler with <strong>formation and cooldown-focused combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Strategic draft system and <strong>hero-defining passive powers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪄 Merge and manipulate Runes for <strong>customizable Viking effects</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 Unique Viking classes and abilities with <strong>synergy-driven gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Mix of PvE encounters and <strong>async PvP battles</strong> with ranked opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛡 No microtransactions – a <strong>fully premium, progression-based experience</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will your clan survive the chaos? Or will your saga be lost in the mist?</strong> <strong>Prepare your warband. Forge your legacy. Become… <i>Raidbound</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛡️ RAIDBOUND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Tactical Viking Auto-Battler with Roguelite Worker Placement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Raidbound</i>, you lead a clan of fearless Vikings through a mythic gauntlet of combat, sacrifice, and divine favor. This is no idle expedition—each decision shapes the fate of your warband.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit your warriors from the Tavern, train them in the ways of battle, and prepare them for war. Infuse them with ancient runes, forge legendary weapons, or sacrifice them to strengthen the clan. Once your energy for the year is spent, you must Raid—battling another player’s clan in asynchronous auto-combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles, travel across a living map of strategic Nodes. Each offers a different boon—or risk. The road to glory is yours to choose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/314f6c268b4748b8014d8d4dfb52594d.poster.avif?t=1763397478\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/314f6c268b4748b8014d8d4dfb52594d.webm?t=1763397478\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696020/extras/314f6c268b4748b8014d8d4dfb52594d.mp4?t=1763397478\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚔️ Vikings &amp; Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Viking joins your clan with a unique ability and one of four roles:<br><strong>Raider</strong>, <strong>Warden</strong>, <strong>Berserker</strong>, or <strong>Skirmisher</strong>.<br>Roles create synergies—like Wardens granting bonus armor when grouped.</p></li><